          "branch_key": "root_000121/B002",
          "role": "Penetrating inner discernment preserves cognition inside the failure."
        }
      ],
      "changed_reading": {
        "before": "They missed the path because they could not perceive it.",
        "after": "They perceived enough, but attraction attached to their own conduct displaced what their discernment could register."
      }
    },
    {
      "model_id": "baseline_dwellings_as_stilled_testimony",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "focus_anchor": "تبيّن لكم من مساكنهم",
      "mechanism": "The source phrase makes the dwellings disclose. The s-k-n inventory lets habitation and cessation coexist, so occupied stability has become motionless residue that speaks after its occupants.",
      "activation_trace": [
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:38/r02",
          "branch_key": "root_000170/B004",
          "role": "Disclosure turns the surviving locations into intelligible evidence."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:38/r03",
          "branch_key": "root_000726/B002",
          "role": "Inhabiting a house gives the remains their former social and domestic function."
