          "branch_key": "root_000222/B001",
          "role": "Adhesion to the ground embodies life arrested at the very place of residence."
        }
      ],
      "structural_cues": [
        "The sequence moves from a clear sign left behind, through shaking and ground-bound inhabitants in their home, directly into disclosure from dwellings."
      ],
      "reader_inference": "The packet supplies a preserved marker, disruptive motion, grounded bodies, and the focus's dwellings; I infer that the event halts habitation and thereby converts it into evidence. The live alternative is ordinary archaeological survival without any intended bodily-cast relationship.",
      "changed_reading": {
        "before": "The dwellings testify because empty ruins happen to survive.",
        "after": "The ruined home is a functional reversal: what once stabilized life now fixes the inhabitants' ending into the landscape."
      }
    },
    {
      "model_id": "delta_culpable_lucidity",
      "status": "strengthened",
      "confidence": "strong",
      "mechanism": "Clear proofs followed by self-magnification and failed escape, then clear signs held at the chest-source of action yet knowingly denied, make mustabṣirīn culpable lucidity: evidence reaches the agent, but pride governs behavioral output.",
      "activation_trace": [
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:38/r10",
          "branch_key": "root_000121/B002",
          "role": "Inner penetration and verification make the retained capacity more than bare eyesight."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:39/r02",
          "branch_key": "root_000170/B004",
          "role": "Openly manifested proofs confirm that the informational channel was not closed."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:39/r03",
          "branch_key": "root_001281/B006",
          "role": "Self-exalting greatness supplies a motive that can override acknowledged evidence."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:39/r06",
          "branch_key": "root_000671/B004",
          "role": "Escape from a pursuer supplies the imagined immunity that the sequence denies."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:40/r13",
          "branch_key": "root_001533/B012",
          "role": "The self as the very entity involved locates the resulting injury within their own agency."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:49/r03",
          "branch_key": "root_000849/B004",
          "role": "An interior source from which acts issue places clear signs at the behavioral source."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:49/r05",
          "branch_key": "root_001040/B001",
          "role": "Cognitive disclosure supplies genuine knowledge rather than an accidental impression."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:49/r06",
          "branch_key": "root_000224/B001",
          "role": "Denial despite knowledge supplies volitional resistance after recognition."
        }
      ],
      "structural_cues": [
        "Immediately after the focus, proofs lead not to confusion but to arrogance and failed outstripping; later, clear signs are placed in knowing chests while denial is still possible."
      ],
      "reader_inference": "The packet supplies proofs, pride, inability to escape, interiorized signs, and knowing denial; I infer that pride changes evidence's behavioral effect from guidance into perceived exemption. A live alternative is that mustabṣirīn denotes worldly cleverness or self-assured perceptiveness rather than acknowledged moral truth.",
      "changed_reading": {
        "before": "The closing participle merely adds irony: intelligent people acted foolishly.",
        "after": "Their very lucidity intensifies agency and culpability, because self-magnification converts recognized evidence into a sense of mastery or exemption."
      }
    },
    {
      "model_id": "delta_weak_shelter_misread_as_strength",
      "status": "new",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "mechanism": "The doubled taking of patrons and a spider-house, followed by explicit weakness, recasts beautification as faulty load-bearing judgment: deeds and affiliations feel like a comforting dwelling while constituting a shelter unable to protect.",
      "activation_trace": [
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:38/r03",
          "branch_key": "root_000726/B004",
          "role": "A refuge toward which the self settles supplies the felt comfort of the false structure."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:38/r04",
          "branch_key": "root_000660/B002",
          "role": "Applied attractiveness makes vulnerability look habitable and sound."
