      ],
      "structural_cues": [
        "The focus's sequence is deeds acting through attraction to block persons; the later sequence establishes a practice that blocks indecency and the repudiated."
      ],
      "reader_inference": "The packet supplies two opposed inhibitors and a practice of renewed recollection; I infer that disciplined repetition can weaken the adorned habit-route and reopen action toward the path. A live alternative is that prayer's restraint is normative or dispositional rather than an automatic psychological mechanism.",
      "changed_reading": {
        "before": "Once the path is cognitively visible, better information should defeat diversion.",
        "after": "Direction requires a counter-forming practice that inhibits rival behavior; insight without such enacted restraint remains vulnerable."
      }
    },
    {
      "model_id": "delta_beautified_deeds_return_as_experience",
      "status": "new",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "mechanism": "Appearance dominates the focus; later encompassing covering and the command to taste what was done reverse the sensory register. The deed once consumed as beautiful returns as an environment that encloses and is bodily experienced.",
      "activation_trace": [
        {
