          "branch_key": "root_001088/B002",
          "role": "A covering that envelops supplies total contact rather than distant observation."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:55/r08",
          "branch_key": "root_000526/B002",
          "role": "Experiential tasting makes the result of conduct bodily known."
        },
        {
          "occurrence_id": "29:55/r10",
          "branch_key": "root_001046/B001",
          "role": "The repeated deed-root identifies deliberate action as what is tasted."
        }
      ],
      "structural_cues": [
        "Encompassment is spatialized from above and beneath, then immediately interpreted by the command to taste what you used to do."
      ],
      "reader_inference": "The packet supplies beautified deeds, total enclosure, sensory tasting, and repeated reference to doing; I infer that conduct returns as experienced consequence rather than merely earning an unrelated penalty. The live alternative is that tasting is a conventional idiom for recompense with no material-return claim.",
      "changed_reading": {
        "before": "Their attractive deeds merely cause a later punishment.",
        "after": "The sensory surface is reversed: what looked consumable and beautiful becomes the enclosing experience they themselves must consume."
      }
    },
    {
      "model_id": "delta_provision_tether_released",
      "status": "revised",
      "confidence": "exploratory",
      "mechanism": "The peripheral s-k-n image of sufficient pasture or provision that prevents departure is activated by wide earth, promised re-lodging, and creatures not carrying their own allotment. Local livelihood can tether a person to an adorned settlement; provision relocated to God releases movement.",
